Z||000010||BC-GT||10-26-2001||10:53 PM||||I put a set on my rebuilt 2.8 They look very nice and have a slightly deeper tone(rumble) then stock manifolds. Like the others stated in this thread, if you are just getting them for the horsepower, prolly not the best place to look for it. My firewall manifold came off in 2 seperate pieces and I couldn't find a nice one in town at the wreckers so...<BR>GM here wants $350+tax(:bs <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">per side.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
